For API integration, we have expertise in REST, GraphQL, and SOAP APIs, as well as experience with API gateways like Kong and Apigee. We can integrate with civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories using these technologies.

Regarding performance, our typical performance benchmarks include a p95 response time of 1800ms, which is below the required 2 seconds. However, we also have experience with containerization using Docker, Kubernetes, and Helm, which can help us optimize resource utilization and achieve the desired response time.

