To meet the requirement of no dependency on non-European suppliers, we can rely on our existing partnerships with EU-based cloud providers and technology vendors.

As for the proposed architecture, I would suggest a hybrid cloud deployment using SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure, with containerized microservices for API integration, EDM, and user directories. We can use our experience with Terraform and Ansible for infrastructure-as-code and configuration management to ensure smooth deployment and maintenance.

Additionally, we can leverage our expertise in cybersecurity to implement network segmentation, mTLS between services, and encryption at rest and in transit to ensure the security of the solution. Our experience with secrets management tools like HashiCorp Vault and CyberArk Conjur will also help us protect sensitive data.

Overall, our current stack and expertise can meet the client's requirements, and we propose a hybrid cloud architecture with containerized microservices, API integration, and a focus on security and high availability.
